title: "Stream Assembly Is an Uncontrolled Treatment in Streaming Intrusion-Detection Benchmarks: Reproducibility Package"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata. Version 1.0.0
  of this record lineage (doi:10.5281/zenodo.20074590, deposited 2026-05-07)
  archives the pre-audit codebase cited by arXiv:2605.24696 v1/v2. The
  corrected rebuild publishes as version 2.0.0 under the same concept DOI
  (10.5281/zenodo.20074589); once its version DOI is minted it belongs in a
  doi field here, superseded in turn by each later release's own DOI. An
  earlier revision of this message said no deposit had been published and that
  the cited DOI was never minted; both claims were false (corrected incident
  CI-36).
